CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:IMRC festivals & holidays
X-WR-CALDESC:Hindu and Jain dates follow the panchang for Washington\, D.C.
  Tithis change at local sunrise\, so a date can differ by a day in other N
 orth American cities or in India. Check your own city on drikpanchang.com 
 before planning an event.
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1W
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:P1W
